  "limitations": [
    "Haiku 5.5 is priced by prompt length: prompts over 100,000 tokens cost five times the standard rate on every line. Claude Code receipts hold cumulative session usage, not per-request prompt sizes, so a run's true API price cannot be split between the tiers. Each run carries Claude Code's own list-price total, which prices each request at its own tier, beside a floor (every request at the standard tier) and a ceiling (every request at the over-100k tier).",
    "Floor and ceiling price cache writes at the 5-minute rate, as the harness cards do. Two runs (medium lodgecore and max depotcore) wrote cache entries with the 1-hour TTL, which costs more, so Claude Code's total for them sits up to 0.4% above the ceiling.",
    "Cost per task covers all 23 runs in a cell. The harness cards average the judged runs, so their figures at medium, extra-high and max ($1.41, $0.87 and $1.55) differ slightly from this bundle's ($1.36, $0.84 and $1.54).",
    "No Batch, Fast or priority pricing is applied."
  ],
